I got this one too, when I tried to include the OPENWINBUG #define.
When I got rid of it, the problem went away, everything compiled
beautifully and it worked. Now, I'm running OpenWindows 2 here, but
we also have X11 available. If you have both, USE X11! Forget the
OpenWindows procedures given in /win/X11/Install. The X11-compiled
version will work fine even if you're running the OW2 window system.

